        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PP2280, 3.5\" by 15\" Heavy Duty Push Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHeavy duty, this door push plate is made of high quality solid brass for longevity. It measures 3-1/2\" inches wide and 15 inches long. Available in different finishes choices; it comes packaged with matching finish brass mounting screws for easy installation. It features a matching finish trim ring. The flat portion of the push plate sets inside a lip on the inside of the trim, and once screwed down, makes for a very durable and secure door push plate. For commercial or residential use. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-PP2280_size.gif?v=1704354679\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana PP2280 3.5\" x 15\" Heavy Duty Push Plate Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-3-5-x-20-push-plate-solid-brass-deltana-pp2281\"><b>3.5\" x 20\" Heavy Duty Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana PP2280 Door Push Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Frame Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flat Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PP2280.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PP2280 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
