                "title": "Heavy Duty 3.5 x 15 Push Plate",
                "description": "Solid Brass 3.5 x 15 Heavy Duty Push Plate, Deltana PP2280 - Heavy duty, this door push plate is made of high quality solid brass for longevity. It measures 3.5 inches wide and 15 inches long. Available in 6 different finishes choices; it comes packaged with matching finish brass mounting screws for easy installation. It features a matching finish trim ring. The flat portion of the push plate sets inside a lip on the inside of the trim, and once screwed down, makes for a very durable and secure door push plate. For commercially or residential use. Manufactured by Deltana, the nation\u0019s most complete provider of all of your architectural door hardware needs.",
